wallpaper-con-citas (1.0.8) resolute; urgency=medium
  * The Prem quotes might be getting blocked due to too many requests. We are now loading them locally from the `banco.json` file. And minor code refinements.
  * It was necessary to correct an error related to \"Other authors.\" It only displays the following: No citations found. /Final revision.
  * Latest fixes; Added writing "metadata" to image. Changed so that it does not overwrite if the quote is changed. And it was fixed at the Quote Edition in the image, more stable.
  * Add a transparent option to text background.
  * Fix a bug on "Other authors" download quotes method.
  * Now, images can be downloaded from additional servers, such as pixabay.com and www.pexels.com. We also have a comprehensive «Otros autores» list—downloaded just once—that simplifies the process of searching for authors and retrieving citations.
  * Add the icon file.
  * An application for downloading wallpapers from Wallhaven/Picsum and overlaying stylized quotes—in English or Spanish—directly onto the image. Initial release.

